#: ../developer/configuration.md:322
msgid "How the two layers combine"
msgstr "两层如何叠加"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:324
msgid ""
"The registry is loaded first and the stored state is applied on top of "
"it, in this order at boot; each admin change is also applied to the "
"running router the moment it is saved."
msgstr "启动时先加载注册表，再按下面的顺序把已存状态叠加上去；管理员的每次改动在保存时也会立即应用到运行中的 router 上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:328
msgid "Custom provider definitions, skipping any slug the code or registry owns."
msgstr "自定义 provider 定义；代码或注册表里已有的 slug 会被跳过。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:329
msgid ""
"Stored provider keys, seeded into each provider's pool beside the "
"environment keys."
msgstr "已存的 provider key，加入各个 provider 的 key 池，与环境变量里的 key 并列。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:331
msgid "Per-model router strategy overrides."
msgstr "按模型设置的 router 策略覆盖项。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:332
msgid ""
"Runtime routes. A runtime model is restored only if its creation "
"finished; a stored route whose model is no longer in the registry is "
"skipped with a warning, so removing a model from YAML does not bring it "
"back through a leftover row."
msgstr ""
"运行时路由。运行时模型只有在创建过程完整结束后才会被恢复；如果一条已存路由对应的模型已经不在注册表里，它会被跳过并记录警告，所以从 YAML "
"里删掉一个模型，不会因为一行残留数据又把它带回来。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:336
msgid "Route overrides, retargeting the registry routes they name."
msgstr "路由覆盖项，把对应的注册表路由改指到新的目标。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:337
msgid ""
"Key tier reservations, re-read now that every provider is known; then "
"weight overrides, disabled providers, offload routes and model "
"visibility, loaded into resolvers the router consults at request time."
msgstr ""
"key 的层级预留：此时所有 provider 都已加载，所以再读一遍。然后是权重覆盖项、已禁用的 "
"provider、卸载路由和模型可见性，这些会加载到解析器里，供 router 在处理请求时查询。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:341
msgid ""
"Two rules follow from that order. A stored change never edits the file it"
" overrides: delete the override and the registry route, weight or "
"`router:` value is back, and a runtime candidate sits beside the "
"registry's routes rather than replacing them. And the file still wins for"
" anything the store has no row for, so a registry edit plus restart is "
"how catalog metadata, aliases and new adapter kinds change."
msgstr ""
"由这个顺序可以得出两条规则。第一，已存的改动从不修改它覆盖的文件：删掉覆盖项，注册表里的路由、权重或 `router:` "
"值就恢复了；运行时添加的候选路由和注册表的路由并存，而不是取代它们。第二，存储里没有记录的内容仍以文件为准，所以要改目录元数据、别名或新增 "
"adapter kind，还是得改注册表再重启。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:348
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:350
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The gateway reads a `.env` file from its working directory and the "
"process environment, case-insensitively; the process environment wins. "
"`.env.example` in the repository root is the annotated list — copy it to "
"`.env` and edit. [Installation](installation.md#environment-variables) "
"lists the variables you are most likely to set. Secrets belong here and "
"only here: not in the model registry (reference them as `${VAR}`), not in"
" the manifest."
msgstr ""
"网关会读取工作目录下的 `.env` 文件和进程环境变量，不区分大小写；两者冲突时以进程环境变量为准。仓库根目录下的 `.env.example`"
" 是带注释的变量清单——把它复制成 `.env` 再改。[安装](installation.md#environment-"
"variables)列出了你最可能要设置的变量。密钥只能放在这里：不要放进模型注册表（在那里用 `${VAR}` 引用），也不要放进 "
"manifest。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:357
msgid "Running with your configuration"
msgstr "用你自己的配置运行"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:363
msgid "Then check what actually loaded:"
msgstr "然后检查实际加载了什么："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:370
msgid ""
"The startup log says what was loaded. `Registered N routes from <path>` "
"names the registry file that was used; `[distribution dark mode] ...` "
"lines show what a manifest would change once activated; `Skipping model "
"'<id>' ... after env expansion` names each model whose credentials were "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"启动日志会告诉你加载了什么。`Registered N routes from <path>` "
"指出实际使用的是哪个注册表文件；`[distribution dark mode] ...` 这几行显示 manifest "
"启用后会改变什么；`Skipping model '<id>' ... after env expansion` 逐个列出凭据没有设置的模型。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:376
msgid ""
"`GET /routing` requires no credentials and returns, for every published "
"route, the upstream `base_url`, its provider label and its weight — that "
"is, your complete upstream topology including any host and port embedded "
"in a base URL. Block `/routing` at your reverse proxy on any gateway "
"reachable from the internet unless you intend to publish this topology. "
"`GET /admin/routing` additionally reports unpublished routes and requires"
" an administrator's JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN` in the `Authorization: Bearer "
"...` header. Treat both endpoints' output as sensitive."
msgstr ""
"`GET /routing` 不需要任何凭据，会返回每条已发布路由的上游 `base_url`、provider "
"标签和权重——也就是你完整的上游拓扑，包括 base URL 里的主机和端口。如果网关能从公网访问，而你又不打算公开这份拓扑，就在反向代理上屏蔽 "
"`/routing`。`GET /admin/routing` 还会返回未发布的路由，需要在 `Authorization: Bearer "
"...` 头里带上管理员的 JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`。两个接口的输出都要当作敏感信息。"

